<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="God-Ish"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Will Stetson"/><amll:meta key="album" value="God-Ish - Single"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="QZK6H2293260"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1633319441"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation xml:lang="zh-Hans" type="subtitle"><text for="L1">哦 我的天</text><text for="L2">爱情终究以分手收场 或是差不多的结局</text><text for="L3">你的人生终会归于死亡 诸如此类</text><text for="L4">真是有意思啊 反正我也无从知晓</text><text for="L5">只能猜测故事的结局 就是这样 哦</text><text for="L6">Tu-tu-ru, tu-tu-tu-ru, like</text><text for="L7">Tu-tu-ru, tu-tu-tu-ru, like</text><text for="L8">Tu-tu-ru, tu-tu-tu-ru, like</text><text for="L9">像什么呢 像什么呢</text><text for="L10">Tu-tu-ru, tu-tu-tu-ru, like</text><text for="L11">Tu-tu-ru, tu-tu-tu-ru, like</text><text for="L12">Tu-tu-ru, tu-tu-tu-ru, a God-ish like</text><text for="L13">够了 别再说了 快住口 住口</text><text for="L14">我心绪翻涌 浑身滚烫</text><text for="L15">太宏大 真宏大 梦想多宏大 太宏大</text><text for="L16">大把钞票滚滚而来 直到最后 耶 耶</text><text for="L17">上帝已死</text><text for="L18">那可真像神啊 宝贝 承认吧</text><text for="L19">没错 怎么看都像神一样<span ttm:role="x-bg">(我的天)</span></text><text for="L20">想要你 好想要你 智商直线下坠 流进下水道</text><text for="L21">真是邪恶透顶啊 宝贝</text><text for="L22">反正我也一样邪恶<span ttm:role="x-bg">(我的天)</span></text><text for="L23">恨死你 恨死你 给我让开</text><text for="L24">你那难看的染发 你的眼睛 还有满溢的谎言</text><text for="L25">还有你的气味 衣裳 和买来的那些腮红</text><text for="L26">就是那副模样 亲爱的 承认吧 你追逐的就是那一套</text><text for="L27">你引经据典 自吹自擂 还有那些评论</text><text for="L28">你八面玲珑 谈笑风生 还有你的种种见解</text><text for="L29">真像神啊 宝贝 认清事实吧 就那样 就那样 叫我发狂</text><text for="L30">Tu-tu-ru, tu-tu-tu-ru, like</text><text for="L31">Tu-tu-ru, tu-tu-tu-ru, like</text><text for="L32">Tu-tu-ru, tu-tu-tu-ru, like</text><text for="L33">像什么呢 像什么呢</text><text for="L34">Tu-tu-ru, tu-tu-tu-ru, like</text><text for="L35">Tu-tu-ru, tu-tu-tu-ru, like</text><text for="L36">Tu-tu-ru, tu-tu-tu-ru, a God-ish like</text><text for="L37">想得太远 是灵魂深处的焦虑吗？</text><text for="L38">一面又俯视着凡夫俗子那愚蠢的追求？</text><text for="L39">无所事事地日渐老去 实在艰难</text><text for="L40">当所有指路的明灯都已被售卖</text><text for="L41">我们扮作神明 堵住传道者长久以来的教诲</text><text for="L42">登上王座 孤身统御一切</text><text for="L43">一篇自省的祷词 独自评判着他人 这是——</text><text for="L44">你知道吗？</text><text for="L45">你在胡说什么啊 蠢货 全是废话 真是的</text><text for="L46">听不懂你放的什么屁 只觉得昏昏欲睡</text><text for="L47">我们缺乏关注 好吧 大家都这么说</text><text for="L48">给我点酷炫的东西 让我尽情起舞 笑逐颜开</text><text for="L49">恶心 真恶心 天啊恶心透了 恶心</text><text for="L50">我竟迷上了本该厌恶的东西</text><text for="L51">狭小 真狭小 你的心胸太狭小 狭小得很</text><text for="L52">你比旁人都聪明 所以孤身一人 最聪明 最出众</text><text for="L53">上帝已死</text><text for="L54">那可真像神啊 宝贝 承认吧</text><text for="L55">没错 无论如何都像神一样<span ttm:role="x-bg">(我的天)</span></text><text for="L56">明明快要死去 却向上帝发誓自己依然健康</text><text for="L57">这也太令人沮丧了</text><text for="L58">想必你巴不得升职加薪吧<span ttm:role="x-bg">(我的天)</span></text><text for="L59">多可悲 多可悲 生不逢时的模仿者</text><text for="L60">你的头衔 你的艺术 你那华丽的故事</text><text for="L61">你的演唱会 特别的歌 还有那愚蠢的旋律</text><text for="L62">就是那副模样 亲爱的 承认吧 你追逐的还是那一套</text><text for="L63">你引经据典 自吹自擂 还有那些评论</text><text for="L64">你擅长交际 爱说笑 还有你的种种见解</text><text for="L65">真像神啊 宝贝 面对现实吧 就那样 就那样 叫我发狂 发狂</text><text for="L66">Tu-tu-ru, tu-tu-tu-ru, like</text><text for="L67">Tu-tu-ru, tu-tu-tu-ru, like</text><text for="L68">Tu-tu-ru, tu-tu-tu-ru, like</text><text for="L69">像什么呢 像什么呢</text><text for="L70">Tu-tu-ru, tu-tu-tu-ru, like</text><text for="L71">Tu-tu-ru, tu-tu-tu-ru, like</text><text for="L72">Tu-tu-ru, tu-tu-tu-ru, a God-ish like</text><text for="L73">爱情终究以分手收场 大概是这样</text><text for="L74">你的人生终会归于死亡 大概如此</text><text for="L75">躲在背后窥视的滋味 还真有意思啊</text><text for="L76">我更喜欢从前只顾跳舞 不问缘由的日子 这就是人生</text></translation></translations><songwriters><songwriter>PinocchioP</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="3:21.190"><div begin="0:05.859" end="3:21.190"><p begin="0:05.859" end="0:06.550" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:05.859" end="0:05.970">Oh,</span> <span begin="0:05.970" end="0:06.140">my</span> <span begin="0:06.140" end="0:06.550">God</span></p><p begin="0:06.750" end="0:09.780" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:06.750" end="0:07.110">Love</span> <span begin="0:07.110" end="0:07.460">ends</span> <span begin="0:07.460" end="0:07.620">in</span> <span begin="0:07.620" end="0:07.790">break</span><span begin="0:07.790" end="0:07.960">ing</span> <span begin="0:07.960" end="0:08.250">up,</span> <span begin="0:08.250" end="0:08.310">or</span> <span begin="0:08.310" end="0:08.410">there</span> <span begin="0:08.410" end="0:08.720">some</span><span begin="0:08.720" end="0:09.050">thing</span> <span begin="0:09.050" end="0:09.780">close</span></p><p begin="0:09.900" end="0:13.250" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:09.900" end="0:10.110">Your</span> <span begin="0:10.110" end="0:10.480">life</span> <span begin="0:10.480" end="0:10.820">ends</span> <span begin="0:10.820" end="0:10.990">in</span> <span begin="0:10.990" end="0:11.210">dy</span><span begin="0:11.210" end="0:11.340">ing</span> <span begin="0:11.340" end="0:11.670">out,</span> <span begin="0:11.670" end="0:11.730">or</span> <span begin="0:11.730" end="0:12.130">some</span><span begin="0:12.130" end="0:12.430">thing</span> <span begin="0:12.430" end="0:13.250">close</span></p><p begin="0:13.510" end="0:16.410" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:13.510" end="0:13.750">Man,</span> <span begin="0:13.750" end="0:13.830">it's</span> <span begin="0:13.830" end="0:14.150">so</span> <span begin="0:14.150" end="0:14.420">damn</span> <span begin="0:14.420" end="0:14.550">in</span><span begin="0:14.550" end="0:14.680">ter</span><span begin="0:14.680" end="0:14.710">est</span><span begin="0:14.710" end="0:15.000">ing,</span> <span begin="0:15.000" end="0:15.140">'cause</span> <span begin="0:15.140" end="0:15.210">I</span> <span begin="0:15.210" end="0:15.550">would</span><span begin="0:15.550" end="0:15.750">n't</span> <span begin="0:15.750" end="0:16.410">know</span></p><p begin="0:16.710" end="0:20.260" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:16.710" end="0:16.800">On</span><span begin="0:16.800" end="0:16.890">ly</span> <span begin="0:16.890" end="0:17.120">guess</span><span begin="0:17.120" end="0:17.550">ing</span> <span begin="0:17.550" end="0:17.630">the</span> <span begin="0:17.630" end="0:17.950">sto</span><span begin="0:17.950" end="0:18.110">ry's</span> <span begin="0:18.110" end="0:18.410">end,</span> <span begin="0:18.410" end="0:18.630">here's</span> <span begin="0:18.630" end="0:18.950">how</span> <span begin="0:18.950" end="0:19.180">it</span> <span begin="0:19.180" end="0:19.670">goes,</span> <span begin="0:19.670" end="0:19.900">oh-</span><span begin="0:19.900" end="0:20.260">on</span></p><p begin="0:20.425" end="0:22.020" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:20.425" end="0:20.640">Tu-</span><span begin="0:20.640" end="0:20.840">tu-</span><span begin="0:20.840" end="0:20.970">ru,</span> <span begin="0:20.970" end="0:21.190">tu-</span><span begin="0:21.190" end="0:21.400">tu-</span><span begin="0:21.400" end="0:21.570">tu-</span><span begin="0:21.570" end="0:21.730">ru,</span> <span begin="0:21.730" end="0:22.020">like</span></p><p begin="0:22.077" end="0:23.750" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:22.077" end="0:22.330">Tu-</span><span begin="0:22.330" end="0:22.530">tu-</span><span begin="0:22.530" end="0:22.660">ru,</span> <span begin="0:22.660" end="0:22.880">tu-</span><span begin="0:22.880" end="0:23.080">tu-</span><span begin="0:23.080" end="0:23.260">tu-</span><span begin="0:23.260" end="0:23.420">ru,</span> <span begin="0:23.420" end="0:23.750">like</span></p><p begin="0:23.780" end="0:25.4